4680/extras/ff45a98eff5d8d638ded129c42dbbca1.webm?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/ff45a98eff5d8d638ded129c42dbbca1.mp4?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qingyu:</strong> The elder twin sister, a surgeon by profession, who seems to be a good girl usually...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.poster.avif?t=1774281171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.webm?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.mp4?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bingyu</strong>: The younger twin sister, a game streamer by profession, skilled in voice acting and cosplay\u2014your sexy little enchantress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.poster.avif?t=1774281171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.webm?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.mp4?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luoxi</strong>: A movie star, the queen  before millions of her fans\u2014but with you, she\u2019s just a lovestruck little woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.poster.avif?t=1774281171\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.webm?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.mp4?t=1774281171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive | Deeply Immersive Simulation Experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of this game, you're not playing as a character with a certain name\u2014your girls won\u2019t call you by a name that isn\u2019t yours. Believe it\u2014YOU, the one in front of screen, is the protagonist definitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019d like, you can tap on the blank WhatsApp profile picture to upload your own. You can also turn off the protagonist\u2019s voice, read the subtitles, and speak to them yourself\u2014truly, madly, deeply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love and be brave! Just as if these girls were right there beside you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well-Designed Branching Storyline | Unique Time-Rewind System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive stories\u00a0certainly come with countless branching choices. Choices are essential for immersive interactive experience, yet they can also be a stress for many players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don\u2019t have to bother which choice is the \u201cright\u201d one: <br>In the case of infinite respawns, death is just so so\u2014It's part of the story we want you to experience. No big deal\u2014take a leap of faith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, no need to worry about making wrong choice and messing up \u201caffection meter\u201d\u2014Your girls love you with all heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint: The storyline tree in this game is not just a video playback selection place. After death, it\u2019s a higher-dimensional space where you can choose the time point to return to in the PAST\u2014Remember that you can rewind time, but you can\u2018\u2019t jump  to the future or a parallel timeline  to the present.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professionally Crafted Screenplay | Twists and Turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a seasoned player who enjoys erotic elements, congratulations\u2014This story is made for you! You\u2019ll get the most complete experience! XD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a movie fan who values a compelling narrative, welcome\u2014Here you\u2019ll find a well-structured five-act drama, highlighted character arcs, and a climactic ending full of surprises\u2026 You\u2019ll feel it was worth the price of admission. Please experience the unique charm of a perfect fusion of film and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s traverse the narrow cliffside paths, manage the schedule of playboy, return to the very beginning, cross the abyss of bloody endings, and turn the gears of fate\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximized Use of PC Peripherals | Ingenious Interactive Mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, this game does have some QTE\u2014not to test your reflexes, but to simulate the protagonist\u2019s physical reactions using just keyboard and mouse in the absence of motion-sensing devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don\u2019t worry if you fail any QTE\u2014we\u2019ve also crafted interesting storylines for QTE failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a microphone, you\u2019ll get an even more immersive experience\u2014Multiple voice-controlled mechanics,  speak up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 4K resolution settings, with HD video assets encoded at 20,000 kbps. Please ensure you have enough disk space before downloading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all. <i>Starting Life in Another World\u00a0</i>as a playboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u5fc3\u5bbf\u5f71\u89c6"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/797c7aa45c8949a868f1a208beddd18fa7480e91/header.jpg?t=1774281171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734680/1276958845/0ee62be3cdea41a32890319e16fcb98ab602cdf3/1750430077/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763040219","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734680/1276958845/0ee62be3cdea41a32890319e16fcb98ab602cdf3/1750430077/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763040219","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734680/1276958845/0ee62be3cdea41a32890319e16fcb98ab602cdf3/1750430077/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763040219","id":257152858,"name":"\u9884\u544a\u7247\uff08\u8868\uff09","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152858/d971695058244920e44d4497e338c48971e1de31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763040219"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734680/2037859923/4a5e7e94db2c58ca10bcf8e92f50202ea33b2ce6/177313782